<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - COCA-COLA CUT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - COCA-COLA CUT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns downgraded Coca-Cola Co to neutral from buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Coca-Cola lost 2-9/16 to 60-1/8.</p>
</text>
